{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地男星范丞丞日前一日官宣「一劇一綜藝」成熱話，近日他與憑《早春晴朗》爆紅的孫千合作新劇《璀璨之上》，開工即成為追訪目標，型格上陣的丞丞與穿透視露背旗袍的孫千組成「耀眼CP」，襯到絕！</p><p>綜藝方面，丞丞跟白鹿合作《奔跑吧》系列，更在宣傳片中鬥講</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.139596+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.764721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.764721+00:00","content_hash":"acf76c91201f0234046e11dd619a74a53f3a934d8de5d6aafa83004c215255f0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}